    <panel_attributes>Legend (background colour = layer)
blue: presentation (React components, REST controllers, CLI)
yellow: application facade
green: AI agent
white: domain model
grey: data access and integration

Associations that cross layers are shown as typed
attributes to keep the diagram readable.</panel_attributes>
